/// Runs a block in another process and answers what it raised (or nil),
/// so a test can use an Exchange from a non-owner (as spike 2's runner).
typed Actor subclass: OtherProcess

  run: block :: Block(Object) -> Object =>
    [
      block value
      nil
    ] on: Exception do: [:e | e]
